:: Nightmare Test
<<effects>>

<<link [[에덴 악몽|Nightmare Eden]]>><<set $sleephour to 1>><<set $nightmareExit to "Eden Cabin Bed">><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[원혼 악몽|Nightmare Wraith]]>><<set $sleephour to 1>><<set $nightmareExit to "Bed">><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[하퍼 악몽|Nightmare Harper]]>><<set $sleephour to 1>><<set $nightmareExit to "Bed">><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[거대 매 악몽|Nightmare Bird]]>><<set $sleephour to 1>><<set $nightmareExit to "Bird Tower Bed">><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[타락한 시드니 악몽|Nightmare Corrupt Sydney]]>><<set $sleephour to 1>><<set $nightmareExit to "Bed">><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[알렉스 악몽|Nightmare Alex]]>><<set $sleephour to 1>><<set $nightmareExit to "Farm Alex Bed">><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[절망의 굴레 악몽|Nightmare Witch]]>><<set $sleephour to 1>><<set $nightmareExit to "Bed">><</link>>
